 underworld in Fortune Valley you can  start your engines of ps4 Xbox one and  PC on  November 10th fingers crossed for some  actual fast and furious DLC down the  road you don't even one that girl oh did  you think the 3ds was done Mario Party  the top 100 is here to prove you wrong  there have been quite a few games in the  Mario Party series but this collection  brings together all of the best  minigames over the years with new  options to keep things moving faster and  thanks to Download Play all it takes is  one copy to play local multiplayer with  your friends you can get the party  started in the US on Friday the 10th and  now for a very different handheld  Nintendo experience doom is making its  way to the switch which means you can  visit Mars and slay demons anywhere this  is the same game that came to other  consoles last year with its competitive  multiplayer available as a free separate  download though it is worth mentioning  that the game deliberately runs at 30  frames per second Doom tears into the  Nintendo switch on the 10th and those  are some of the hottest games we'll be  playing this week as always remember  that release dates are based on retailer  listings and are subject to change  thanks for watching guys and I'll be  back with another dose of new releases  next Sunday  you

